	<bf:code>txt</bf:code>
      </bf:Content>
    </bf:content>
    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>""The storm of the century has cut Gasper's Cove Island off from the mainland of Nova Scotia. Valerie and the crafters are used to being snowed in and they use the time to catch up on news and old projects. When a forgotten murder is revealed, the crafters are forced to accept that the only way to lay an unsolved crime to rest is to solve it"-- Provided by publisher"-- Provided by publisher.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
